# Thespian's Stage becomes a copy of Adventurer's Inn: it was already on the battlefield, so it doesn't enter and the Inn's
# "When this land enters, you gain 2 life" doesn't trigger (CR 603.6a; the ruling: "No enters-the-battlefield abilities of the
# land Thespian's Stage is copying will trigger"). Bot1's life is the 22 the Inn itself gave. The Stage is a Town named
# Adventurer's Inn (CR 707.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Thespian's Stage
Sol Ring
Adventurer's Inn
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Thespian's Stage.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Thespian's Stage.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Adventurer's Inn.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 22
Bot1.Battlefield.Thespian's Stage.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Adventurer's Inn; Ability: becomes)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot1.Battlefield = Sol Ring; Adventurer's Inn; Adventurer's Inn
Bot1.Battlefield.Adventurer's Inn#1.Subtypes = Town
Stack.Count = 0
